      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/dekorra_wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "A dam constructed upstream in 1909 created Lake Wisconsin, which flooded farmland but boosted recreational opportunities in Dekorra.",
